# Brazen Borrower goes on an Adventure (CR 715): on turn 3 Bot1 casts it as Petty Theft for {1}{U}, returning Bot2's Sol
# Ring to Bot2's hand. While it is on the stack it is Petty Theft, and as it resolves it is exiled rather than put into
# the graveyard. With a third Island down, in Bot2's end step on turn 6 Bot1 casts the Borrower itself from exile, with flash, for {1}{U}{U}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Island
Brazen Borrower
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Sol Ring
Island x12

